-wise route"}]," — stations already passed and those still upcoming, with halt information where available."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Cancellation and diversion notices"}]," — surfaced when the railway data reports them for that run."]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Running information reflects the most recent report available from railway sources, so the displayed position can lag between station reports. Estimated timings are projections and can shift while a train is en route."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-4","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-xl font-black text-main","children":"Live train status — frequently asked questions"}],["$","dl",null,{"className":"space-y-5","children":[["$","div","What is live train running status?",{"className":"space-y-1.5","children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"text-sm font-bold text-main","children":"What is live train running status?"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"text-sm text-secondary leading-relaxed","children":"Live train running status is the current running information for a train on a given day: the station it was last reported at, whether it is on time or delayed, and the expected arrival and departure times at the stations still ahead on its route."}]]}],["$","div","How can I check my train's live running status on Trayago?",{"className":"space-y-1.5","children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"text-sm font-bold text-main","children":"How can I check my train's live running status on Trayago?"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"text-sm text-secondary leading-relaxed","children":"Enter the train number in the field at the top of this page and select Track Train. Trayago loads the current running information for that train, including its progress along the route, delay against the scheduled timetable, and station-wise timings. Selecting a different journey date lets you look at the relevant run of the train."}]]}],"$L50","$L51","$L52","$L53","$L54","$L55","$L56","$